щё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Запасной путь оказался завален. Весь поток придётся пропустить через этот рубеж. Нина отмечает безопасные повороты на карте и передаёт короткий приказ. Участок E-190. Задача участка: Не дать перерезать путь к полевой кухне.", "objective": "Не дать перерезать путь к полевой кухне.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. Связисты докладывают: маршрут снова работает. Полевая кухня · E-190.", "letter": "Полевая кухня · E-190. Белов говорит, что хорошая позиция начинается с заботы о соседнем расчёте.", "waves": 50, "id": 989, "rank": 32.17467, "firstReward": 442, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46593, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 190, "pressure": 2.995 }, { "title": "Промежуточная база · E-191", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "fog", "base": "Промежуточная база", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Запасной путь оказался завален. Весь поток придётся пропустить через этот рубеж. Нина отмечает безопасные повороты на карте и передаёт короткий приказ. Участок E-191. Задача участка: Защитить промежуточную базу снабжения.", "objective": "Защитить промежуточную базу снабжения.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. Связисты докладывают: маршрут снова работает. Промежуточная база · E-191.", "letter": "Промежуточная база · E-191. Нина снова пересчитала письма. Ни одно не осталось на дороге.", "waves": 50, "id": 990, "rank": 32.20721, "firstReward": 442, "repeatReward": 212, "layoutSeed": 46630, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 191, "pressure": 2.997 }, { "title": "Расчистка завала · E-192", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "mud", "base": "Расчистка завала", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Запасной путь оказался завален. Весь поток придётся пропустить через этот рубеж. Нина отмечает безопасные повороты на карте и передаёт короткий приказ. Участок E-192. Задача участка: Выиграть время для расчистки завала на дороге.", "objective": "Выиграть время для расчистки завала на дороге.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. Связисты докладывают: маршрут снова работает. Расчистка завала · E-192.", "letter": "Расчистка завала · E-192. Нина снова пересчитала письма. Ни одно не осталось на дороге.", "waves": 50, "id": 991, "rank": 32.23974, "firstReward": 442, "repeatReward": 213, "layoutSeed": 46667, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 192, "pressure": 2.999 }, { "title": "До последней машины", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 2, "weather": "ash", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Удержать заключительный рубеж прикрытия", "quote": "«Не все важные грузы помещаются в ведомость».", "story": "Остаётся пропустить одну машину. Белов не сворачивает позиции: обещание считается выполненным только до конца. До следующего сигнала остаётся мало времени. Удержать дорогу предстоит теми силами, которые уже на месте.", "objective": "Удержать заключительный рубеж прикрытия.", "tip": "Не тратьте весь запас сразу. Сочетайте улучшения с постройкой позиций на следующем участке.", "outro": "Дорога снова принадлежит колонне. Нина проверяет письма, а Соколов благодарит расчёты за удержанный рубеж «До последней машины».", "letter": "«До последней машины». В тетради всё меньше неразобранных адресов. Когда-нибудь я закрою её и напишу письмо без спешки.", "waves": 50, "id": 992, "rank": 32.27227, "firstReward": 443, "repeatReward": 213, "legacyId": 148, "layoutSeed": 148, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 193, "pressure": 3.001 }, { "title": "Госпитальный поворот · E-194", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 23, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Госпитальный поворот", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Разведка обнаружила движение на соседнем просёлке: обходной путь больше не безопасен. Нина отмечает безопасные повороты на карте и передаёт короткий приказ. Участок E-194. Задача участка: Удержать дорогу для санитарных машин.", "objective": "Удержать дорогу для санитарных машин.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. Сапёры убирают заграждения для своих машин. Госпитальный поворот · E-194.", "letter": "Госпитальный поворот · E-194. Нина снова пересчитала письма. Ни одно не осталось на дороге.", "waves": 49, "id": 993, "rank": 32.3048, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46741, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 194, "pressure": 3.003 }, { "title": "Ящики у дороги · E-195", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 9, "weather": "ash", "trait": "none", "base": "Ящики у дороги", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Разведка обнаружила движение на соседнем просёлке: обходной путь больше не безопасен. Нина отмечает безопасные повороты на карте и передаёт короткий приказ. Участок E-195. Задача участка: Защитить разгрузку боеприпасов у просёлка.", "objective": "Защитить разгрузку боеприпасов у просёлка.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. Сапёры убирают заграждения для своих машин. Ящики у дороги · E-195.", "letter": "Ящики у дороги · E-195. Нина снова пересчитала письма. Ни одно не осталось на дороге.", "waves": 49, "id": 994, "rank": 32.33734, "firstReward": 439, "repeatReward": 211, "layoutSeed": 46778, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 195, "pressure": 3.005 }, { "title": "Лесовозная колонна · E-196", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 19, "weather": "ash", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Лесовозная колонна", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Передняя машина остановилась с поломкой, и колонна растянулась у поворота. Нина отмечает безопасные повороты на карте и передаёт короткий приказ. Участок E-196. Задача участка: Провести колонну со стройматериалами через опасный поворот.", "objective": "Провести колонну со стройматериалами через опасный поворот.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. Сапёры убирают заграждения для своих машин. Лесовозная колонна · E-196.", "letter": "Лесовозная колонна · E-196. Усталость приходит после боя. Пока за спиной движется колонна, её почти не замечаешь.", "waves": 47, "id": 995, "rank": 32.36987, "firstReward": 431, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 46815, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 196, "pressure": 3.007 }, { "title": "Курьерский маршрут · E-197", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 5, "weather": "ash", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Курьерский маршрут", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Передняя машина остановилась с поломкой, и колонна растянулась у поворота. Белов ставит запасные ящики рядом с орудиями и напоминает не открывать огонь слишком рано. Участок E-197. Задача участка: Сохранить проход для курьеров и полевой почты.", "objective": "Сохранить проход для курьеров и полевой почты.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. За поворотом слышен сигнал последнего грузовика. Курьерский маршрут · E-197.", "letter": "Курьерский маршрут · E-197. Усталость приходит после боя. Пока за спиной движется колонна, её почти не замечаешь.", "waves": 47, "id": 996, "rank": 32.4024, "firstReward": 431, "repeatReward": 207, "layoutSeed": 46852, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 197, "pressure": 3.009 }, { "title": "Водокачка · E-198", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 15, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Водокачка", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Передняя машина остановилась с поломкой, и колонна растянулась у поворота. Белов ставит запасные ящики рядом с орудиями и напоминает не открывать огонь слишком рано. Участок E-198. Задача участка: Дать водовозам закончить загрузку у водокачки.", "objective": "Дать водовозам закончить загрузку у водокачки.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. За поворотом слышен сигнал последнего грузовика. Водокачка · E-198.", "letter": "Водокачка · E-198. Усталость приходит после боя. Пока за спиной движется колонна, её почти не замечаешь.", "waves": 50, "id": 997, "rank": 32.43493, "firstReward": 443, "repeatReward": 213, "layoutSeed": 46889, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 198, "pressure": 3.011 }, { "title": "Ремонтный двор · E-199", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "industrial", "map": 1, "weather": "ash", "trait": "armor", "base": "Ремонтный двор", "quote": "", "story": "Почтовая сумка становится легче, но колоннам всё ещё нужна безопасная дорога. Рота доводит до конца обещание первого дня. Провод оборван. До восстановления связи расчёты ориентируются по сигнальным флажкам. Белов ставит запасные ящики рядом с орудиями и напоминает не открывать огонь слишком рано. Участок E-199. Задача участка: Оборонять ремонтную площадку до выхода последней машины.", "objective": "Оборонять ремонтную площадку до выхода последней машины.", "tip": "Сочетайте огонь по площади с противотанковыми орудиями. Между волнами чините повреждённые позиции; платная поддержка не обязательна.", "outro": "Рубеж удержан. За поворотом слышен сигнал последнего грузовика. Ремонтный двор · E-199.", "letter": "Ремонтный двор · E-199. Усталость приходит после боя. Пока за спиной движется колонна, её почти не замечаешь.", "waves": 50, "id": 998, "rank": 32.46747, "firstReward": 444, "repeatReward": 213, "layoutSeed": 46926, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 199, "pressure": 3.013 }, { "title": "Последнее письмо", "place": "Берлин", "date": "Май 1945", "chapter": 4, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "ash", "trait": "final", "base": "Эвакуационный пункт", "quote": "«После последнего выстрела работа ещё остаётся».", "story": "Среди последних очагов боёв рота охраняет дорогу к эвакуационному пункту. По ней вывозят раненых и выводят людей из разрушенных кварталов. Это не бой за знамя или здание. Соколову, Нине и Белову нужно сделать то, чему они учились всю войну: сохранить проход для тех, кто идёт за ними.", "objective": "Удержать последний коридор эвакуации.", "tip": "Финальные волны проверят всю оборону. Улучшайте пушки, прикрывайте их огнём по площади и берегите артподдержку.", "outro": "Последняя машина проходит рубеж. Белов складывает инструмент. Нина закрывает пустую почтовую сумку и достаёт чистый лист. Соколов пишет первое письмо, в котором нет просьбы не волноваться: «Мы живы. Возвращаемся».", "letter": "Мы живы. Возвращаемся. Остальное расскажем дома.", "waves": 50, "id": 999, "rank": 32.5, "firstReward": 444, "repeatReward": 213, "legacyId": 149, "layoutSeed": 149, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 200, "pressure": 3.015 }] };
const campaignLocales = { "en": { "version": 3, "campaignSize": 1000, "legacyMap": [0, 7, 14, 21, 27, 34, 41, 48, 55, 62, 69, 75, 82, 89, 96, 103, 110, 117, 124, 130, 137, 144, 151, 158, 165, 172, 178, 185, 192, 199, 200, 207, 214, 221, 227, 234, 241, 248, 255, 262, 269, 275, 282, 289, 296, 303, 310, 317, 324, 330, 337, 344, 351, 358, 365, 372, 378, 385, 392, 399, 400, 407, 414, 421, 427, 434, 441, 448, 455, 462, 469, 475, 482, 489, 496, 503, 510, 517, 524, 530, 537, 544, 551, 558, 565, 572, 578, 585, 592, 599, 600, 607, 614, 621, 627, 634, 641, 648, 655, 662, 669, 675, 682, 689, 696, 703, 710, 717, 724, 730, 737, 744, 751, 758, 765, 772, 778, 785, 792, 799, 800, 807, 814, 821, 827, 834, 841, 848, 855, 862, 869, 875, 882, 889, 896, 903, 910, 917, 924, 930, 937, 944, 951, 958, 965, 972, 978, 985, 992, 999], "chapters": [{ "name": "Time to Retreat", "years": "1941", "note": "Save those behind us before it is too late.", "size": 200, "start": 0, "end": 199 }, { "name": "Learning to Hold", "years": "1941–1942", "note": "From scattered people to one company.", "size": 200, "start": 200, "end": 399 }, { "name": "The Shore of Hope", "years": "1942–1943", "note": "Hold where the road comes to an end.", "size": 200, "start": 400, "end": 599 }, { "name": "The Road Back", "years": "1943", "note": "Return to the places the addresses remember.", "size": 200, "start": 600, "end": 799 }, { "name": "Letters Home", "years": "1944–1945", "note": "Keep the promise made on the first day.", "size": 200, "start": 800, "end": 999 }], "missions": [{ "title": "The First Line", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "training", "base": "Field Hospital", "quote": "“We thought we would have time to write home before the exercises.”", "story": "Lieutenant Alexei Sokolov's engineers must protect the road to a field hospital. Contact with neighbouring units is lost. Radio operator Nina Volkova searches for a signal while Sergeant Mikhail Belov builds a defence from whatever survived the retreat. Behind them, ambulances carry the wounded away. Every minute matters.", "objective": "Hold the hospital road until the evacuation is complete.", "tip": "Machine guns work well against infantry. Place them near bends to keep targets under fire longer.", "outro": "The last ambulance disappears into the forest. Nina picks up a field mailbag from the roadside. Sokolov promises that the letters will not be left behind.", "letter": "Mother, today I learned the worth of one quiet minute. We gave it to people who could not walk away themselves.", "waves": 5, "id": 0, "rank": 0.0, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "legacyId": 0, "layoutSeed": 0, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 1, "pressure": 1.0 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-002", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-002. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-002.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-002. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 5, "id": 1, "rank": 0.03253, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10037, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 2, "pressure": 1.002 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-003", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-003. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-003.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-003. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 5, "id": 2, "rank": 0.06507, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10074, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 3, "pressure": 1.004 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-004", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-004. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-004.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-004. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 5, "id": 3, "rank": 0.0976, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10111, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 4, "pressure": 1.006 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-005", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-005. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-005.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-005. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 5, "id": 4, "rank": 0.13013, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10148, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 5, "pressure": 1.008 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-006", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-006. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-006.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-006. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 6, "id": 5, "rank": 0.16266, "firstReward": 120, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10185, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 6, "pressure": 1.01 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-007", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-007. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-007.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-007. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 6, "id": 6, "rank": 0.1952, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10222, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 7, "pressure": 1.012 }, { "title": "The Hospital Well", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the road while the medics fill their barrels", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "The medics are running out of water. Belov finds an intact well, but the lane leading to it is exposed. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the road while the medics fill their barrels.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Hospital Well — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Hospital Well.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 6, "id": 7, "rank": 0.22773, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "legacyId": 1, "layoutSeed": 1, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 8, "pressure": 1.014 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-009", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-009. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-009.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-009. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 6, "id": 8, "rank": 0.26026, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10296, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 9, "pressure": 1.016 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-010", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-010. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-010.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-010. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 6, "id": 9, "rank": 0.29279, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10333, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 10, "pressure": 1.018 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-011", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 4, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-011. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-011.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-011. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 6, "id": 10, "rank": 0.32533, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10370, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 11, "pressure": 1.02 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-012", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-012. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-012.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-012. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 6, "id": 11, "rank": 0.35786, "firstReward": 121, "repeatReward": 50, "layoutSeed": 10407, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 12, "pressure": 1.022 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-013", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-013. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-013.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-013. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 6, "id": 12, "rank": 0.39039, "firstReward": 122, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10444, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 13, "pressure": 1.024 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-014", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-014. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-014.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-014. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 6, "id": 13, "rank": 0.42292, "firstReward": 122, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10481, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 14, "pressure": 1.026 }, { "title": "Signal at the Treeline", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Hold the crossroads until the stragglers return", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Nina catches a faint call from a straggling platoon. Sokolov places a signal lantern at the edge of the forest. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Hold the crossroads until the stragglers return.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “Signal at the Treeline” on their route map.", "letter": "“Signal at the Treeline.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 6, "id": 14, "rank": 0.45546, "firstReward": 122, "repeatReward": 51, "legacyId": 2, "layoutSeed": 2, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 15, "pressure": 1.028 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-016", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-016. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-016.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-016. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 7, "id": 15, "rank": 0.48799, "firstReward": 122, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10555, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 16, "pressure": 1.03 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-017", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-017. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-017.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-017. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 7, "id": 16, "rank": 0.52052, "firstReward": 122, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10592, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 17, "pressure": 1.032 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-018", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-018. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-018.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-018. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 7, "id": 17, "rank": 0.55305, "firstReward": 122, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10629, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 18, "pressure": 1.034 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-019", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-019. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-019.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-019. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 7, "id": 18, "rank": 0.58559, "firstReward": 123, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10666, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 19, "pressure": 1.036 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-020", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-020. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-020.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-020. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 7, "id": 19, "rank": 0.61812, "firstReward": 123, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10703, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 20, "pressure": 1.038 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-021", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-021. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-021.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-021. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 7, "id": 20, "rank": 0.65065, "firstReward": 123, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10740, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 21, "pressure": 1.04 }, { "title": "The Broken Telephone Line", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the signallers as they repair the line", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The wire to the neighbouring position has been cut. Two signallers leave to find the break, taking the company's hopes with them. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the signallers as they repair the line.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Broken Telephone Line” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Broken Telephone Line.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 7, "id": 21, "rank": 0.68318, "firstReward": 123, "repeatReward": 51, "legacyId": 3, "layoutSeed": 3, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 22, "pressure": 1.042 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-023", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-023. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-023.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-023. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 7, "id": 22, "rank": 0.71572, "firstReward": 123, "repeatReward": 51, "layoutSeed": 10814, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 23, "pressure": 1.044 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-024", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-024. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-024.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-024. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 8, "id": 23, "rank": 0.74825, "firstReward": 123, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 10851, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 24, "pressure": 1.046 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-025", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-025. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-025.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-025. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 6, "id": 24, "rank": 0.78078, "firstReward": 124, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 10888, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 25, "pressure": 1.048 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-026", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-026. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-026.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-026. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 7, "id": 25, "rank": 0.81331, "firstReward": 124, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 10925, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 26, "pressure": 1.05 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-027", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-027. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-027.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-027. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 8, "id": 26, "rank": 0.84585, "firstReward": 124, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 10962, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 27, "pressure": 1.052 }, { "title": "Canvas for the Wounded", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Protect the approaches to the stranded truck", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Heavy rain begins during the night. A truck carrying tents is stuck beside the road, and Belov refuses to abandon it. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the approaches to the stranded truck.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “Canvas for the Wounded.”", "letter": "“Canvas for the Wounded.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 8, "id": 27, "rank": 0.87838, "firstReward": 124, "repeatReward": 52, "legacyId": 4, "layoutSeed": 4, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 28, "pressure": 1.054 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-029", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-029. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-029.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-029. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 9, "id": 28, "rank": 0.91091, "firstReward": 124, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 11036, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 29, "pressure": 1.056 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-030", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-030. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-030.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-030. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 9, "id": 29, "rank": 0.94344, "firstReward": 125, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 11073, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 30, "pressure": 1.058 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-031", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-031. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-031.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-031. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 7, "id": 30, "rank": 0.97598, "firstReward": 125, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 11110, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 31, "pressure": 1.061 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-032", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-032. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-032.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-032. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 7, "id": 31, "rank": 1.00851, "firstReward": 125, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 11147, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 32, "pressure": 1.063 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-033", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-033. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-033.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-033. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 8, "id": 32, "rank": 1.04104, "firstReward": 125, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 11184, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 33, "pressure": 1.065 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-034", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-034. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-034.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-034. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 8, "id": 33, "rank": 1.07357, "firstReward": 125, "repeatReward": 52, "layoutSeed": 11221, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 34, "pressure": 1.067 }, { "title": "Five Quiet Minutes", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Hold the fallback position until the convoy leaves", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "The first letter in the bag is addressed to a young family. Sokolov reads only the return address before closing the envelope. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the fallback position until the convoy leaves.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “Five Quiet Minutes.”", "letter": "“Five Quiet Minutes.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 9, "id": 34, "rank": 1.10611, "firstReward": 125, "repeatReward": 52, "legacyId": 5, "layoutSeed": 5, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 35, "pressure": 1.069 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-036", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-036. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-036.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-036. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 10, "id": 35, "rank": 1.13864, "firstReward": 126, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11295, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 36, "pressure": 1.071 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-037", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-037. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-037.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-037. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 8, "id": 36, "rank": 1.17117, "firstReward": 126, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11332, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 37, "pressure": 1.073 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-038", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-038. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-038.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-038. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 9, "id": 37, "rank": 1.2037, "firstReward": 126, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11369, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 38, "pressure": 1.075 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-039", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-039. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-039.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-039. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 9, "id": 38, "rank": 1.23624, "firstReward": 126, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11406, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 39, "pressure": 1.077 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-040", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-040. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-040.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-040. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 10, "id": 39, "rank": 1.26877, "firstReward": 126, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11443, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 40, "pressure": 1.079 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-041", "place": "Western Border", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-041. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-041.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-041. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 10, "id": 40, "rank": 1.3013, "firstReward": 126, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11480, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 41, "pressure": 1.081 }, { "title": "The Mail Truck", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Evacuation Column", "quote": "“A whole peaceful life is inside this bag.”", "story": "A damaged communications truck joins the company. Its cargo includes batteries, maps and bags of unsent letters. Belov suggests leaving the extra weight, but Nina insists on saving the mail. As a mechanic repairs the engine, enemy scouts approach the road.", "objective": "Cover the truck repairs and the convoy's withdrawal.", "tip": "Scouts are faster than ordinary infantry. Keep a firing position near the exit.", "outro": "The engine finally starts. Belov silently covers the mailbags with waterproof canvas.", "letter": "I kept a letter without an address. The envelope only says “To Vera.” I hope we will find the sender.", "waves": 8, "id": 41, "rank": 1.33383, "firstReward": 127, "repeatReward": 53, "legacyId": 6, "layoutSeed": 6, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 42, "pressure": 1.083 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-043", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-043. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-043.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-043. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 8, "id": 42, "rank": 1.36637, "firstReward": 127, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11554, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 43, "pressure": 1.085 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-044", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-044. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-044.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-044. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 9, "id": 43, "rank": 1.3989, "firstReward": 127, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11591, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 44, "pressure": 1.087 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-045", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-045. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-045.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-045. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 9, "id": 44, "rank": 1.43143, "firstReward": 127, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11628, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 45, "pressure": 1.089 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-046", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-046. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-046.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-046. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 11, "id": 45, "rank": 1.46396, "firstReward": 127, "repeatReward": 53, "layoutSeed": 11665, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 46, "pressure": 1.091 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-047", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-047. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-047.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-047. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 11, "id": 46, "rank": 1.4965, "firstReward": 127, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11702, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 47, "pressure": 1.093 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-048", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-048. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-048.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-048. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 9, "id": 47, "rank": 1.52903, "firstReward": 128, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11739, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 48, "pressure": 1.095 }, { "title": "The Unsealed Envelope", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the convoy assembly point", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Nina finds an unaddressed letter in the mail truck. She recognises the handwriting of a soldier from a neighbouring crew. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the convoy assembly point.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Unsealed Envelope — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Unsealed Envelope.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 9, "id": 48, "rank": 1.56156, "firstReward": 128, "repeatReward": 54, "legacyId": 7, "layoutSeed": 7, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 49, "pressure": 1.097 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-050", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-050. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-050.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-050. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 10, "id": 49, "rank": 1.59409, "firstReward": 128, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11813, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 50, "pressure": 1.099 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-051", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-051. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-051.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-051. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 10, "id": 50, "rank": 1.62663, "firstReward": 128, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11850, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 51, "pressure": 1.101 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-052", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-052. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-052.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-052. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 11, "id": 51, "rank": 1.65916, "firstReward": 128, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11887, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 52, "pressure": 1.103 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-053", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-053. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-053.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-053. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 11, "id": 52, "rank": 1.69169, "firstReward": 128, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11924, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 53, "pressure": 1.105 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-054", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-054. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-054.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-054. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 9, "id": 53, "rank": 1.72422, "firstReward": 129, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11961, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 54, "pressure": 1.107 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-055", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-055. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-055.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-055. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 9, "id": 54, "rank": 1.75676, "firstReward": 129, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 11998, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 55, "pressure": 1.109 }, { "title": "The Green Barn", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the field mail store", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The mailbags are soaked. Belov hangs them to dry in a surviving barn while scouts report movement along the road. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the field mail store.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Green Barn” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Green Barn.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 11, "id": 55, "rank": 1.78929, "firstReward": 129, "repeatReward": 54, "legacyId": 8, "layoutSeed": 8, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 56, "pressure": 1.111 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-057", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-057. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-057.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-057. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 11, "id": 56, "rank": 1.82182, "firstReward": 129, "repeatReward": 54, "layoutSeed": 12072, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 57, "pressure": 1.113 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-058", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-058. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-058.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-058. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 12, "id": 57, "rank": 1.85435, "firstReward": 129, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12109, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 58, "pressure": 1.115 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-059", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-059. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-059.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-059. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 12, "id": 58, "rank": 1.88689, "firstReward": 130, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12146, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 59, "pressure": 1.117 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-060", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-060. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-060.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-060. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 10, "id": 59, "rank": 1.91942, "firstReward": 130, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12183, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 60, "pressure": 1.119 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-061", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-061. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-061.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-061. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 10, "id": 60, "rank": 1.95195, "firstReward": 130, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12220, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 61, "pressure": 1.121 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-062", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-062. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-062.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-062. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 11, "id": 61, "rank": 1.98448, "firstReward": 130, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12257, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 62, "pressure": 1.123 }, { "title": "The Broken Axle", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Defend the repair site", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The only working truck breaks an axle. Its driver asks for time to build one vehicle from two wrecks. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the repair site.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Broken Axle” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Broken Axle.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 11, "id": 62, "rank": 2.01702, "firstReward": 130, "repeatReward": 55, "legacyId": 9, "layoutSeed": 9, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 63, "pressure": 1.125 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-064", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-064. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-064.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-064. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 12, "id": 63, "rank": 2.04955, "firstReward": 130, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12331, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 64, "pressure": 1.127 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-065", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-065. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-065.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-065. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 12, "id": 64, "rank": 2.08208, "firstReward": 131, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12368, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 65, "pressure": 1.129 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-066", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-066. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-066.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-066. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 11, "id": 65, "rank": 2.11461, "firstReward": 131, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12405, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 66, "pressure": 1.131 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-067", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-067. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-067.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-067. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 11, "id": 66, "rank": 2.14715, "firstReward": 131, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12442, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 67, "pressure": 1.133 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-068", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-068. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-068.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-068. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 12, "id": 67, "rank": 2.17968, "firstReward": 131, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12479, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 68, "pressure": 1.135 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-069", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-069. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-069.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-069. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 12, "id": 68, "rank": 2.21221, "firstReward": 131, "repeatReward": 55, "layoutSeed": 12516, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 69, "pressure": 1.137 }, { "title": "The Unmarked Turn", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Keep the enemy away from the supply columns", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Supply columns keep losing the road at night. Sokolov sends soldiers to put up signs while the company holds the junction. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Keep the enemy away from the supply columns.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Unmarked Turn.”", "letter": "“The Unmarked Turn.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 13, "id": 69, "rank": 2.24474, "firstReward": 135, "repeatReward": 58, "legacyId": 10, "layoutSeed": 10, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 70, "pressure": 1.139 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-071", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-071. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-071.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-071. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 13, "id": 70, "rank": 2.27728, "firstReward": 136, "repeatReward": 58, "layoutSeed": 12590, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 71, "pressure": 1.141 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-072", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-072. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-072.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-072. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 11, "id": 71, "rank": 2.30981, "firstReward": 132, "repeatReward": 56, "layoutSeed": 12627, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 72, "pressure": 1.143 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-073", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-073. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-073.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-073. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 11, "id": 72, "rank": 2.34234, "firstReward": 132, "repeatReward": 56, "layoutSeed": 12664, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 73, "pressure": 1.145 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-074", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-074. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-074.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-074. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 12, "id": 73, "rank": 2.37487, "firstReward": 132, "repeatReward": 56, "layoutSeed": 12701, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 74, "pressure": 1.147 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-075", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-075. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-075.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-075. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 13, "id": 74, "rank": 2.40741, "firstReward": 136, "repeatReward": 58, "layoutSeed": 12738, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 75, "pressure": 1.149 }, { "title": "Names in a Notebook", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Hold the road to the next camp", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Nina copies water-damaged addresses into a small notebook. Beside every name, she leaves an empty line. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Hold the road to the next camp.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “Names in a Notebook.”", "letter": "“Names in a Notebook.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 14, "id": 75, "rank": 2.43994, "firstReward": 140, "repeatReward": 60, "legacyId": 11, "layoutSeed": 11, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 76, "pressure": 1.151 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-077", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-077. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-077.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-077. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 12, "id": 76, "rank": 2.47247, "firstReward": 133, "repeatReward": 56, "layoutSeed": 12812, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 77, "pressure": 1.153 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-078", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-078. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-078.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-078. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 12, "id": 77, "rank": 2.50501, "firstReward": 133, "repeatReward": 56, "layoutSeed": 12849, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 78, "pressure": 1.155 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-079", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-079. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-079.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-079. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 13, "id": 78, "rank": 2.53754, "firstReward": 137, "repeatReward": 58, "layoutSeed": 12886, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 79, "pressure": 1.157 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-080", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-080. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-080.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-080. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 13, "id": 79, "rank": 2.57007, "firstReward": 137, "repeatReward": 58, "layoutSeed": 12923, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 80, "pressure": 1.159 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-081", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-081. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-081.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-081. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 14, "id": 80, "rank": 2.6026, "firstReward": 141, "repeatReward": 61, "layoutSeed": 12960, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 81, "pressure": 1.161 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-082", "place": "Forest Road", "date": "June 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-082. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-082.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-082. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 14, "id": 81, "rank": 2.63514, "firstReward": 141, "repeatReward": 61, "layoutSeed": 12997, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 82, "pressure": 1.163 }, { "title": "The Wooden Bridge", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "River Crossing", "quote": "“The bridge must last one more column.”", "story": "The company reaches a small crossing. The timber deck cannot bear the stream of vehicles, so engineers reinforce it while traffic continues. Sokolov receives his first heavy gun. Enemy transports are now bringing reinforcements along with the infantry.", "objective": "Prevent the enemy from cutting off the crossing.", "tip": "The anti-tank gun pierces armour, but needs support against infantry.", "outro": "Once the column crosses, engineers remove the last signal flags. Nina marks her map for the first time: “In time.”", "letter": "Father, you taught me to build bridges. Today I first held a plank on which so many people depended.", "waves": 12, "id": 82, "rank": 2.66767, "firstReward": 134, "repeatReward": 57, "legacyId": 12, "layoutSeed": 12, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 83, "pressure": 1.165 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-084", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-084. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-084.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-084. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 12, "id": 83, "rank": 2.7002, "firstReward": 134, "repeatReward": 57, "layoutSeed": 13071, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 84, "pressure": 1.167 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-085", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-085. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-085.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-085. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 13, "id": 84, "rank": 2.73273, "firstReward": 138, "repeatReward": 59, "layoutSeed": 13108, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 85, "pressure": 1.169 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-086", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-086. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-086.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-086. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 14, "id": 85, "rank": 2.76527, "firstReward": 142, "repeatReward": 61, "layoutSeed": 13145, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 86, "pressure": 1.171 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-087", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-087. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-087.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-087. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 15, "id": 86, "rank": 2.7978, "firstReward": 146, "repeatReward": 63, "layoutSeed": 13182, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 87, "pressure": 1.173 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-088", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-088. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-088.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-088. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 15, "id": 87, "rank": 2.83033, "firstReward": 147, "repeatReward": 63, "layoutSeed": 13219, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 88, "pressure": 1.175 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-089", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-089. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-089.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-089. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 13, "id": 88, "rank": 2.86286, "firstReward": 139, "repeatReward": 59, "layoutSeed": 13256, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 89, "pressure": 1.177 }, { "title": "Dry Planks", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Cover the delivery of bridge planks", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "Carpenters have found spare boards for the bridge. The only way to bring them in is a narrow road along the bank. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the delivery of bridge planks.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “Dry Planks — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“Dry Planks.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 13, "id": 89, "rank": 2.8954, "firstReward": 139, "repeatReward": 59, "legacyId": 13, "layoutSeed": 13, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 90, "pressure": 1.18 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-091", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-091. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-091.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-091. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 14, "id": 90, "rank": 2.92793, "firstReward": 143, "repeatReward": 61, "layoutSeed": 13330, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 91, "pressure": 1.182 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-092", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-092. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-092.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-092. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 14, "id": 91, "rank": 2.96046, "firstReward": 143, "repeatReward": 61, "layoutSeed": 13367, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 92, "pressure": 1.184 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-093", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-093. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-093.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-093. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 15, "id": 92, "rank": 2.99299, "firstReward": 147, "repeatReward": 64, "layoutSeed": 13404, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 93, "pressure": 1.186 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-094", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-094. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-094.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-094. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 15, "id": 93, "rank": 3.02553, "firstReward": 148, "repeatReward": 64, "layoutSeed": 13441, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 94, "pressure": 1.188 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-095", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 4, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-095. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-095.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-095. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 13, "id": 94, "rank": 3.05806, "firstReward": 140, "repeatReward": 60, "layoutSeed": 13478, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 95, "pressure": 1.19 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-096", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-096. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-096.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-096. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 14, "id": 95, "rank": 3.09059, "firstReward": 144, "repeatReward": 62, "layoutSeed": 13515, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 96, "pressure": 1.192 }, { "title": "The Ferry Cable", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Defend the approach to the landing", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The ferry is stuck in midstream. While engineers stretch a new cable, Sokolov positions his guns at the landing. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the approach to the landing.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Ferry Cable” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Ferry Cable.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 15, "id": 96, "rank": 3.12312, "firstReward": 148, "repeatReward": 64, "legacyId": 14, "layoutSeed": 14, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 97, "pressure": 1.194 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-098", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-098. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-098.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-098. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 15, "id": 97, "rank": 3.15566, "firstReward": 148, "repeatReward": 64, "layoutSeed": 13589, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 98, "pressure": 1.196 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-099", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-099. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-099.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-099. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 16, "id": 98, "rank": 3.18819, "firstReward": 152, "repeatReward": 66, "layoutSeed": 13626, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 99, "pressure": 1.198 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-100", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-100. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-100.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-100. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 15, "id": 99, "rank": 3.22072, "firstReward": 149, "repeatReward": 64, "layoutSeed": 13663, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 100, "pressure": 1.2 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-101", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-101. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-101.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-101. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 14, "id": 100, "rank": 3.25325, "firstReward": 145, "repeatReward": 62, "layoutSeed": 13700, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 101, "pressure": 1.202 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-102", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-102. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-102.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-102. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 14, "id": 101, "rank": 3.28579, "firstReward": 145, "repeatReward": 62, "layoutSeed": 13737, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 102, "pressure": 1.204 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-103", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "marsh", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-103. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-103.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-103. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 15, "id": 102, "rank": 3.31832, "firstReward": 149, "repeatReward": 64, "layoutSeed": 13774, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 103, "pressure": 1.206 }, { "title": "Two Signal Flares", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hold the communications post at the crossing", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "The far bank is waiting for an agreed signal. Nina must relay the crossing order without losing a single vehicle. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the communications post at the crossing.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “Two Signal Flares” to the company's story.", "letter": "“Two Signal Flares.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 15, "id": 103, "rank": 3.35085, "firstReward": 149, "repeatReward": 65, "legacyId": 15, "layoutSeed": 15, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 104, "pressure": 1.208 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-105", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-105. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-105.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-105. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 16, "id": 104, "rank": 3.38338, "firstReward": 153, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 13848, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 105, "pressure": 1.21 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-106", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-106. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-106.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-106. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 16, "id": 105, "rank": 3.41592, "firstReward": 154, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 13885, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 106, "pressure": 1.212 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-107", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-107. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-107.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-107. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 14, "id": 106, "rank": 3.44845, "firstReward": 146, "repeatReward": 63, "layoutSeed": 13922, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 107, "pressure": 1.214 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-108", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-108. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-108.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-108. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 14, "id": 107, "rank": 3.48098, "firstReward": 146, "repeatReward": 63, "layoutSeed": 13959, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 108, "pressure": 1.216 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-109", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-109. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-109.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-109. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 15, "id": 108, "rank": 3.51351, "firstReward": 150, "repeatReward": 65, "layoutSeed": 13996, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 109, "pressure": 1.218 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-110", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-110. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-110.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-110. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 16, "id": 109, "rank": 3.54605, "firstReward": 154, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 14033, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 110, "pressure": 1.22 }, { "title": "Wet Powder", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Cover the crossing with limited forces", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Some ammunition crates have been soaked. Belov shares out the usable rounds and tells every crew to make its shots count. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Cover the crossing with limited forces.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “Wet Powder.”", "letter": "“Wet Powder.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 16, "id": 110, "rank": 3.57858, "firstReward": 154, "repeatReward": 67, "legacyId": 16, "layoutSeed": 16, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 111, "pressure": 1.222 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-112", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-112. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-112.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-112. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 14, "id": 111, "rank": 3.61111, "firstReward": 147, "repeatReward": 63, "layoutSeed": 14107, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 112, "pressure": 1.224 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-113", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-113. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-113.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-113. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 15, "id": 112, "rank": 3.64364, "firstReward": 151, "repeatReward": 65, "layoutSeed": 14144, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 113, "pressure": 1.226 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-114", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-114. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-114.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-114. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 16, "id": 113, "rank": 3.67618, "firstReward": 155, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 14181, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 114, "pressure": 1.228 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-115", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-115. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-115.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-115. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 16, "id": 114, "rank": 3.70871, "firstReward": 155, "repeatReward": 68, "layoutSeed": 14218, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 115, "pressure": 1.23 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-116", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-116. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-116.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-116. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 17, "id": 115, "rank": 3.74124, "firstReward": 159, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 14255, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 116, "pressure": 1.232 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-117", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "coast", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-117. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-117.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-117. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 17, "id": 116, "rank": 3.77377, "firstReward": 160, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 14292, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 117, "pressure": 1.234 }, { "title": "The Last Raft", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Secure the landing for the raft's passengers", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A raft carrying tools and people drifts downriver. Sokolov chooses a safe place to bring it ashore. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Secure the landing for the raft's passengers.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Last Raft.”", "letter": "“The Last Raft.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 15, "id": 117, "rank": 3.80631, "firstReward": 152, "repeatReward": 66, "legacyId": 17, "layoutSeed": 17, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 118, "pressure": 1.236 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-119", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-119. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-119.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-119. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 15, "id": 118, "rank": 3.83884, "firstReward": 152, "repeatReward": 66, "layoutSeed": 14366, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 119, "pressure": 1.238 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-120", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-120. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-120.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-120. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 16, "id": 119, "rank": 3.87137, "firstReward": 156, "repeatReward": 68, "layoutSeed": 14403, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 120, "pressure": 1.24 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-121", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-121. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-121.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-121. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 16, "id": 120, "rank": 3.9039, "firstReward": 156, "repeatReward": 68, "layoutSeed": 14440, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 121, "pressure": 1.242 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-122", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-122. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-122.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-122. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 17, "id": 121, "rank": 3.93644, "firstReward": 160, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 14477, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 122, "pressure": 1.244 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-123", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-123. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-123.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-123. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 17, "id": 122, "rank": 3.96897, "firstReward": 161, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 14514, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 123, "pressure": 1.246 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-124", "place": "Approaches to Smolensk", "date": "July 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "river", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-124. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-124.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-124. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 15, "id": 123, "rank": 4.0015, "firstReward": 153, "repeatReward": 66, "layoutSeed": 14551, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 124, "pressure": 1.248 }, { "title": "The Railway Junction", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Supply Train", "quote": "“Until the train leaves, the station is ours.”", "story": "A train carrying food and machine tools is stranded at a small station. Its locomotive needs repairs. The company occupies ruined warehouses as railway workers move supplies toward the tracks. Sokolov has plenty of materials, but the defensive route is long.", "objective": "Protect the station until the train is ready to depart.", "tip": "Starting supplies: +80. Mortars can hit several targets at once.", "outro": "A locomotive whistle sounds through the smoke. The driver gives Nina a bundle of postcards: “Pass them on when the lines work again.”", "letter": "We are not only evacuating machines. We are carrying the hope that one day they will make peaceful things again.", "waves": 15, "id": 124, "rank": 4.03403, "firstReward": 153, "repeatReward": 66, "legacyId": 18, "layoutSeed": 18, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 125, "pressure": 1.25 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-126", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-126. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-126.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-126. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 16, "id": 125, "rank": 4.06657, "firstReward": 157, "repeatReward": 68, "layoutSeed": 14625, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 126, "pressure": 1.252 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-127", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-127. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-127.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-127. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 16, "id": 126, "rank": 4.0991, "firstReward": 157, "repeatReward": 69, "layoutSeed": 14662, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 127, "pressure": 1.254 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-128", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-128. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-128.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-128. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 17, "id": 127, "rank": 4.13163, "firstReward": 161, "repeatReward": 71, "layoutSeed": 14699, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 128, "pressure": 1.256 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-129", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-129. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-129.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-129. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 17, "id": 128, "rank": 4.16416, "firstReward": 162, "repeatReward": 71, "layoutSeed": 14736, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 129, "pressure": 1.258 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-130", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 18, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-130. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-130.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-130. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 15, "id": 129, "rank": 4.1967, "firstReward": 154, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 14773, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 130, "pressure": 1.26 }, { "title": "The Spare Semaphore", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Protect the signal post", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The station keeper signals the trains by hand. Without him, they would stop in the open. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Protect the signal post.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Spare Semaphore — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Spare Semaphore.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 15, "id": 130, "rank": 4.22923, "firstReward": 154, "repeatReward": 67, "legacyId": 19, "layoutSeed": 19, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 131, "pressure": 1.262 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-132", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 14, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-132. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-132.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-132. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 16, "id": 131, "rank": 4.26176, "firstReward": 158, "repeatReward": 69, "layoutSeed": 14847, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 132, "pressure": 1.264 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-133", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 0, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-133. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Observation Post · A-133.", "letter": "Observation Post · A-133. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 16, "id": 132, "rank": 4.29429, "firstReward": 158, "repeatReward": 69, "layoutSeed": 14884, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 133, "pressure": 1.266 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-134", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 10, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-134. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-134.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-134. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 17, "id": 133, "rank": 4.32683, "firstReward": 162, "repeatReward": 71, "layoutSeed": 14921, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 134, "pressure": 1.268 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-135", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 20, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-135. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-135.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-135. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 17, "id": 134, "rank": 4.35936, "firstReward": 163, "repeatReward": 71, "layoutSeed": 14958, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 135, "pressure": 1.27 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-136", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 6, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-136. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-136.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-136. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 15, "id": 135, "rank": 4.39189, "firstReward": 155, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 14995, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 136, "pressure": 1.272 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-137", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-137. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-137.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-137. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 15, "id": 136, "rank": 4.42442, "firstReward": 155, "repeatReward": 67, "layoutSeed": 15032, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 137, "pressure": 1.274 }, { "title": "The Platform Watchmaker", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 11, "weather": "dust", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the station workshop", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "An elderly mechanic repairs radio instruments on an empty platform. To Nina, his box of spare parts is worth more than a new set. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the station workshop.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Platform Watchmaker” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Platform Watchmaker.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 16, "id": 137, "rank": 4.45696, "firstReward": 159, "repeatReward": 70, "legacyId": 20, "layoutSeed": 20, "original": true, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 138, "pressure": 1.276 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-139", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-139. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-139.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-139. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 17, "id": 138, "rank": 4.48949, "firstReward": 163, "repeatReward": 72, "layoutSeed": 15106, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 139, "pressure": 1.278 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-140", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-140. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-140.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-140. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 18, "id": 139, "rank": 4.52202, "firstReward": 167, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 15143, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 6, "orderInChapter": 140, "pressure": 1.28 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-141", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-141. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-141.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-141. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 140, "rank": 4.55455, "firstReward": 168, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 15180, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 141, "pressure": 1.282 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-142", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 7, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-142. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-142.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-142. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 16, "id": 141, "rank": 4.58709, "firstReward": 160, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 15217, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 142, "pressure": 1.284 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-143", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 17, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-143. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-143.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-143. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 16, "id": 142, "rank": 4.61962, "firstReward": 160, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 15254, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 143, "pressure": 1.286 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-144", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-144. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-144.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-144. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 17, "id": 143, "rank": 4.65215, "firstReward": 164, "repeatReward": 72, "layoutSeed": 15291, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 144, "pressure": 1.288 }, { "title": "The Flour Wagon", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Hold the approach to the food supplies", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A food wagon has been left on a siding. Belov finds volunteers to unload it under the company's protection. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Hold the approach to the food supplies.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Flour Wagon” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Flour Wagon.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 17, "id": 144, "rank": 4.68468, "firstReward": 164, "repeatReward": 72, "legacyId": 21, "layoutSeed": 21, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 145, "pressure": 1.29 }, { "title": "Water Pump · A-146", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-146. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Water Pump · A-146.", "letter": "Water Pump · A-146. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 18, "id": 145, "rank": 4.71722, "firstReward": 169, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 15365, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 146, "pressure": 1.292 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-147", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 9, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-147. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-147.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-147. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 16, "id": 146, "rank": 4.74975, "firstReward": 161, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 15402, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 147, "pressure": 1.294 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-148", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-148. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-148.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-148. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 16, "id": 147, "rank": 4.78228, "firstReward": 161, "repeatReward": 70, "layoutSeed": 15439, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 148, "pressure": 1.297 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-149", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-149. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-149.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-149. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 17, "id": 148, "rank": 4.81481, "firstReward": 165, "repeatReward": 72, "layoutSeed": 15476, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 149, "pressure": 1.299 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-150", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 15, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-150. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-150.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-150. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 17, "id": 149, "rank": 4.84735, "firstReward": 165, "repeatReward": 73, "layoutSeed": 15513, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 150, "pressure": 1.301 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-151", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "ruins", "map": 1, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-151. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-151.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-151. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 18, "id": 150, "rank": 4.87988, "firstReward": 169, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 15550, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 151, "pressure": 1.303 }, { "title": "Switch Number Seven", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Cover the switch repairs", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "A damaged switch traps a hospital train. Railway workers begin repairs just as the attack approaches. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Cover the switch repairs.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “Switch Number Seven.”", "letter": "“Switch Number Seven.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 18, "id": 151, "rank": 4.91241, "firstReward": 170, "repeatReward": 75, "legacyId": 22, "layoutSeed": 22, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 152, "pressure": 1.305 }, { "title": "Observation Post · A-153", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-153. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches 