ed more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-155. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-155.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-155. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 17, "id": 154, "rank": 5.01001, "firstReward": 166, "repeatReward": 73, "layoutSeed": 15698, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 155, "pressure": 1.311 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-156", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "dust", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-156. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-156.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-156. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 17, "id": 155, "rank": 5.04254, "firstReward": 166, "repeatReward": 73, "layoutSeed": 15735, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 156, "pressure": 1.313 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-157", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 13, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-157. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-157.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-157. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 18, "id": 156, "rank": 5.07508, "firstReward": 170, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 15772, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 157, "pressure": 1.315 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-158", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "dust", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-158. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-158.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-158. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 18, "id": 157, "rank": 5.10761, "firstReward": 171, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 15809, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 158, "pressure": 1.317 }, { "title": "The Dawn Whistle", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "armor", "base": "Protect the last train as it departs", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The locomotive sounds a long whistle: it is time to leave. Sokolov keeps the guns in position until the train gathers speed. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Protect the last train as it departs.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Dawn Whistle.”", "letter": "“The Dawn Whistle.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 16, "id": 158, "rank": 5.14014, "firstReward": 163, "repeatReward": 71, "legacyId": 23, "layoutSeed": 23, "original": true, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 159, "pressure": 1.319 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-160", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 19, "weather": "dust", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-160. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-160.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-160. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 16, "id": 159, "rank": 5.17267, "firstReward": 163, "repeatReward": 71, "layoutSeed": 15883, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 7, "orderInChapter": 160, "pressure": 1.321 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-161", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 16, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-161. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-161.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-161. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 17, "id": 160, "rank": 5.20521, "firstReward": 167, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 15920, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 161, "pressure": 1.323 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-162", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 2, "weather": "dust", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-162. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-162.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-162. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 17, "id": 161, "rank": 5.23774, "firstReward": 167, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 15957, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 162, "pressure": 1.325 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-163", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 12, "weather": "dust", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-163. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-163.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-163. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 18, "id": 162, "rank": 5.27027, "firstReward": 171, "repeatReward": 76, "layoutSeed": 15994, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 163, "pressure": 1.327 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-164", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 22, "weather": "dust", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-164. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-164.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-164. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 18, "id": 163, "rank": 5.3028, "firstReward": 172, "repeatReward": 76, "layoutSeed": 16031, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 164, "pressure": 1.329 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-165", "place": "Smolensk Sector", "date": "August 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "industrial", "map": 8, "weather": "dust", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-165. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-165.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-165. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 17, "id": 164, "rank": 5.33534, "firstReward": 168, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 16068, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 165, "pressure": 1.331 }, { "title": "The Way Out of the Forest", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Retreat Corridor", "quote": "“Do not lose one another in this fog.”", "story": "After days of unreliable contact, the company finds a narrow lane toward friendly lines. Scattered soldiers gather in the woods. Nina sets up a radio beacon and Belov marks the route with white ribbons. Fog hides the enemy until close range: weapon range is reduced by 10%.", "objective": "Keep an escape corridor open for straggling units.", "tip": "Engineers slow the enemy, helping make up for the fog's range penalty.", "outro": "Belov returns on the last truck with another group. Sokolov counts everyone twice.", "letter": "The night was so dark we knew our own by their voices. I will never forget those voices.", "waves": 17, "id": 165, "rank": 5.36787, "firstReward": 168, "repeatReward": 74, "legacyId": 24, "layoutSeed": 24, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 166, "pressure": 1.333 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-167", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-167. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-167.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-167. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 166, "rank": 5.4004, "firstReward": 172, "repeatReward": 76, "layoutSeed": 16142, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 167, "pressure": 1.335 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-168", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector A-168. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-168.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-168. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 167, "rank": 5.43293, "firstReward": 172, "repeatReward": 76, "layoutSeed": 16179, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 168, "pressure": 1.337 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-169", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-169. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-169.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-169. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 19, "id": 168, "rank": 5.46547, "firstReward": 176, "repeatReward": 78, "layoutSeed": 16216, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 169, "pressure": 1.339 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-170", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-170. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-170.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-170. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 19, "id": 169, "rank": 5.498, "firstReward": 177, "repeatReward": 78, "layoutSeed": 16253, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 170, "pressure": 1.341 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-171", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-171. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-171.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-171. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 17, "id": 170, "rank": 5.53053, "firstReward": 169, "repeatReward": 74, "layoutSeed": 16290, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 171, "pressure": 1.343 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-172", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-172. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-172.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-172. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 17, "id": 171, "rank": 5.56306, "firstReward": 169, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 16327, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 172, "pressure": 1.345 }, { "title": "The Forester's Trail", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Hold the main road", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "A local forester shows the convoy a hidden route. The company turns the exposed road into a diversionary defence. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Hold the main road.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Forester's Trail — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Forester's Trail.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 18, "id": 172, "rank": 5.5956, "firstReward": 173, "repeatReward": 77, "legacyId": 25, "layoutSeed": 25, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 173, "pressure": 1.347 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-174", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-174. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-174.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-174. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 18, "id": 173, "rank": 5.62813, "firstReward": 173, "repeatReward": 77, "layoutSeed": 16401, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 174, "pressure": 1.349 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-175", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector A-175. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-175.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-175. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 19, "id": 174, "rank": 5.66066, "firstReward": 178, "repeatReward": 79, "layoutSeed": 16438, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 175, "pressure": 1.351 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-176", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-176. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-176.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-176. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 19, "id": 175, "rank": 5.69319, "firstReward": 178, "repeatReward": 79, "layoutSeed": 16475, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 176, "pressure": 1.353 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-177", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-177. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-177.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-177. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 17, "id": 176, "rank": 5.72573, "firstReward": 170, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 16512, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 177, "pressure": 1.355 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-178", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-178. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-178.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-178. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 17, "id": 177, "rank": 5.75826, "firstReward": 170, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 16549, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 178, "pressure": 1.357 }, { "title": "The Empty Battery", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the radio post", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "The radio is losing power. Nina removes a battery from an abandoned vehicle and tries to restore contact. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the radio post.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Empty Battery” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Empty Battery.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 18, "id": 178, "rank": 5.79079, "firstReward": 174, "repeatReward": 77, "legacyId": 26, "layoutSeed": 26, "original": true, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 179, "pressure": 1.359 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · A-180", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-180. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · A-180.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · A-180. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 18, "id": 179, "rank": 5.82332, "firstReward": 174, "repeatReward": 77, "layoutSeed": 16623, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 8, "orderInChapter": 180, "pressure": 1.361 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · A-181", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-181. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Radio Silence · A-181.", "letter": "Radio Silence · A-181. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 19, "id": 180, "rank": 5.85586, "firstReward": 179, "repeatReward": 79, "layoutSeed": 16660, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 181, "pressure": 1.363 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · A-182", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector A-182. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Hospital Bend · A-182.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · A-182. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 17, "id": 181, "rank": 5.88839, "firstReward": 171, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 16697, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 182, "pressure": 1.365 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · A-183", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-183. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Roadside Crates · A-183.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · A-183. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 17, "id": 182, "rank": 5.92092, "firstReward": 171, "repeatReward": 75, "layoutSeed": 16734, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 183, "pressure": 1.367 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · A-184", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-184. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · A-184.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · A-184. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 18, "id": 183, "rank": 5.95345, "firstReward": 175, "repeatReward": 78, "layoutSeed": 16771, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 184, "pressure": 1.369 }, { "title": "Courier Route · A-185", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "autumn", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-185. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Courier Route · A-185.", "letter": "Courier Route · A-185. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 18, "id": 184, "rank": 5.98599, "firstReward": 175, "repeatReward": 78, "layoutSeed": 16808, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 185, "pressure": 1.371 }, { "title": "A Light in the Fog", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Hold the bend until the medical team passes", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "The medics' signal light appears through the fog. One exposed bend still separates them from safety. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Hold the bend until the medical team passes.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “A Light in the Fog” to the company's story.", "letter": "“A Light in the Fog.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 19, "id": 185, "rank": 6.01852, "firstReward": 179, "repeatReward": 80, "legacyId": 27, "layoutSeed": 27, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 186, "pressure": 1.373 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · A-187", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-187. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Repair Yard · A-187.", "letter": "Repair Yard · A-187. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 19, "id": 186, "rank": 6.05105, "firstReward": 180, "repeatReward": 80, "layoutSeed": 16882, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 187, "pressure": 1.375 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · A-188", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-188. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · A-188.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · A-188. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 17, "id": 187, "rank": 6.08358, "firstReward": 172, "repeatReward": 76, "layoutSeed": 16919, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 188, "pressure": 1.377 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · A-189", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector A-189. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Wire through the Woods · A-189.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · A-189. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 17, "id": 188, "rank": 6.11612, "firstReward": 172, "repeatReward": 76, "layoutSeed": 16956, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 189, "pressure": 1.379 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · A-190", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-190. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Sapper Patrol · A-190.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · A-190. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 18, "id": 189, "rank": 6.14865, "firstReward": 176, "repeatReward": 78, "layoutSeed": 16993, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 190, "pressure": 1.381 }, { "title": "Mill Road · A-191", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-191. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Mill Road · A-191.", "letter": "Mill Road · A-191. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 19, "id": 190, "rank": 6.18118, "firstReward": 180, "repeatReward": 80, "layoutSeed": 17030, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 191, "pressure": 1.383 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · A-192", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-192. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · A-192.", "letter": "Assembly Point · A-192. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 20, "id": 191, "rank": 6.21371, "firstReward": 184, "repeatReward": 82, "layoutSeed": 17067, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 192, "pressure": 1.385 }, { "title": "The Fallen Pine", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the road-clearing crew", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A fallen tree blocks the convoy. While engineers clear the road, Belov occupies the nearest rise. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the road-clearing crew.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Fallen Pine.”", "letter": "“The Fallen Pine.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 20, "id": 192, "rank": 6.24625, "firstReward": 185, "repeatReward": 82, "legacyId": 28, "layoutSeed": 28, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 193, "pressure": 1.387 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · A-194", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-194. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Spare Parts Truck · A-194.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · A-194. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 193, "rank": 6.27878, "firstReward": 177, "repeatReward": 78, "layoutSeed": 17141, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 194, "pressure": 1.389 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · A-195", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-195. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Rations Depot · A-195.", "letter": "Rations Depot · A-195. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 194, "rank": 6.31131, "firstReward": 177, "repeatReward": 79, "layoutSeed": 17178, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 195, "pressure": 1.391 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · A-196", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector A-196. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · A-196.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · A-196. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 19, "id": 195, "rank": 6.34384, "firstReward": 181, "repeatReward": 81, "layoutSeed": 17215, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 196, "pressure": 1.393 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · A-197", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-197. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Shelter · A-197.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · A-197. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 19, "id": 196, "rank": 6.37638, "firstReward": 181, "repeatReward": 81, "layoutSeed": 17252, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 197, "pressure": 1.395 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · A-198", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-198. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Field Kitchen · A-198.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · A-198. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 20, "id": 197, "rank": 6.40891, "firstReward": 185, "repeatReward": 83, "layoutSeed": 17289, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 198, "pressure": 1.397 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · A-199", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "mud", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The company is still learning to hold a road during a retreat. Behind every crossroads are people who need more time. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector A-199. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Supply Relay · A-199.", "letter": "Supply Relay · A-199. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 20, "id": 198, "rank": 6.44144, "firstReward": 186, "repeatReward": 83, "layoutSeed": 17326, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 199, "pressure": 1.399 }, { "title": "The Forest Halt", "place": "Vyazma Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 0, "theme": "forest", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Defend the overnight camp", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "For the first time, the company has an hour to rest. Sokolov sends a patrol ahead, but it soon returns with an alarming report. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the overnight camp.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Forest Halt.”", "letter": "“The Forest Halt.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 18, "id": 199, "rank": 6.47397, "firstReward": 178, "repeatReward": 79, "legacyId": 29, "layoutSeed": 29, "original": true, "sector": 9, "orderInChapter": 200, "pressure": 1.401 }, { "title": "The Autumn Line", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Defence Headquarters", "quote": "“The shovel became our first weapon.”", "story": "Young engineers reinforce the company. They dig positions beside the road with help from local residents. Sokolov teaches them to count the time they gain, not the shots they fire. Mud slows the attackers, but fresh waves keep crossing the sodden fields.", "objective": "Cover the deployment of the defence headquarters.", "tip": "Mud slows ground enemies by 8%. Use the extra time to upgrade positions.", "outro": "Headquarters regains a steady radio link. For once, the message is not a retreat request but a confirmation: “Holding.”", "letter": "I thought courage meant not being afraid. Belov says it means not leaving a friend alone with their fear.", "waves": 18, "id": 200, "rank": 6.50651, "firstReward": 178, "repeatReward": 79, "legacyId": 30, "layoutSeed": 30, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 1, "pressure": 1.403 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-002", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-002. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-002.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-002. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 19, "id": 201, "rank": 6.53904, "firstReward": 182, "repeatReward": 81, "layoutSeed": 17437, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 2, "pressure": 1.405 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-003", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-003. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-003.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-003. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 19, "id": 202, "rank": 6.57157, "firstReward": 182, "repeatReward": 81, "layoutSeed": 17474, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 3, "pressure": 1.407 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-004", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 12, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-004. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-004.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-004. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 20, "id": 203, "rank": 6.6041, "firstReward": 187, "repeatReward": 83, "layoutSeed": 17511, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 4, "pressure": 1.409 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-005", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-005. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-005.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-005. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 20, "id": 204, "rank": 6.63664, "firstReward": 187, "repeatReward": 83, "layoutSeed": 17548, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 5, "pressure": 1.411 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-006", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-006. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-006.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-006. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 18, "id": 205, "rank": 6.66917, "firstReward": 179, "repeatReward": 80, "layoutSeed": 17585, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 6, "pressure": 1.413 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-007", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 18, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-007. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-007.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-007. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 18, "id": 206, "rank": 6.7017, "firstReward": 179, "repeatReward": 80, "layoutSeed": 17622, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 7, "pressure": 1.416 }, { "title": "Warm Footwraps", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Protect the supply road", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "Winter clothing is arriving along the road. Belov knows what it means to hold a position in wet clothes, and meets the supply train himself. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Protect the supply road.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “Warm Footwraps — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“Warm Footwraps.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 19, "id": 207, "rank": 6.73423, "firstReward": 183, "repeatReward": 82, "legacyId": 31, "layoutSeed": 31, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 8, "pressure": 1.418 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-009", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 14, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-009. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-009.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-009. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 19, "id": 208, "rank": 6.76677, "firstReward": 183, "repeatReward": 82, "layoutSeed": 17696, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 9, "pressure": 1.42 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-010", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-010. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-010.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-010. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 20, "id": 209, "rank": 6.7993, "firstReward": 188, "repeatReward": 84, "layoutSeed": 17733, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 10, "pressure": 1.422 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-011", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-011. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-011.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-011. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 20, "id": 210, "rank": 6.83183, "firstReward": 188, "repeatReward": 84, "layoutSeed": 17770, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 11, "pressure": 1.424 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-012", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-012. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-012.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-012. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 211, "rank": 6.86436, "firstReward": 180, "repeatReward": 80, "layoutSeed": 17807, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 12, "pressure": 1.426 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-013", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-013. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-013.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-013. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 212, "rank": 6.8969, "firstReward": 180, "repeatReward": 80, "layoutSeed": 17844, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 13, "pressure": 1.428 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-014", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 4, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-014. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-014.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-014. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 19, "id": 213, "rank": 6.92943, "firstReward": 184, "repeatReward": 82, "layoutSeed": 17881, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 14, "pressure": 1.43 }, { "title": "The Clay Cutting", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Cover the recovery of the vehicles", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Vehicles are bogged down in a clay cutting. The company moves its guns onto dry ground to give the recovery tractors time to work. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Cover the recovery of the vehicles.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Clay Cutting” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Clay Cutting.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 19, "id": 214, "rank": 6.96196, "firstReward": 184, "repeatReward": 82, "legacyId": 32, "layoutSeed": 32, "original": true, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 15, "pressure": 1.432 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-016", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 0, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-016. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-016.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-016. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 21, "id": 215, "rank": 6.99449, "firstReward": 193, "repeatReward": 86, "layoutSeed": 17955, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 16, "pressure": 1.434 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-017", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 10, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-017. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-017.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-017. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 21, "id": 216, "rank": 7.02703, "firstReward": 193, "repeatReward": 86, "layoutSeed": 17992, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 17, "pressure": 1.436 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-018", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 20, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-018. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-018.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-018. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 19, "id": 217, "rank": 7.05956, "firstReward": 185, "repeatReward": 83, "layoutSeed": 18029, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 18, "pressure": 1.438 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-019", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 6, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-019. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-019.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-019. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 20, "id": 218, "rank": 7.09209, "firstReward": 189, "repeatReward": 85, "layoutSeed": 18066, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 19, "pressure": 1.44 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-020", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 16, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-020. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-020.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-020. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 22, "id": 219, "rank": 7.12462, "firstReward": 197, "repeatReward": 89, "layoutSeed": 18103, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 0, "orderInChapter": 20, "pressure": 1.442 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-021", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "autumn", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-021. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-021.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-021. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 19, "id": 220, "rank": 7.15716, "firstReward": 185, "repeatReward": 83, "layoutSeed": 18140, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 21, "pressure": 1.444 }, { "title": "A Letter in the Chimney", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 2, "weather": "rain", "trait": "armor", "base": "Hold the approaches to the assembly point", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A hidden envelope is found in an empty house. Without opening it, Nina adds another address to her notebook. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Hold the approaches to the assembly point.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “A Letter in the Chimney” to the company's story.", "letter": "“A Letter in the Chimney.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 19, "id": 221, "rank": 7.18969, "firstReward": 186, "repeatReward": 83, "legacyId": 33, "layoutSeed": 33, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 22, "pressure": 1.446 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-023", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-023. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-023.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-023. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 21, "id": 222, "rank": 7.22222, "firstReward": 194, "repeatReward": 87, "layoutSeed": 18214, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 23, "pressure": 1.448 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-024", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-024. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-024.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-024. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 21, "id": 223, "rank": 7.25475, "firstReward": 194, "repeatReward": 87, "layoutSeed": 18251, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 24, "pressure": 1.45 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-025", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-025. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-025.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-025. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 18, "id": 224, "rank": 7.28729, "firstReward": 182, "repeatReward": 81, "layoutSeed": 18288, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 25, "pressure": 1.452 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-026", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-026. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-026.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-026. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 18, "id": 225, "rank": 7.31982, "firstReward": 182, "repeatReward": 81, "layoutSeed": 18325, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 26, "pressure": 1.454 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-027", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-027. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-027.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-027. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 20, "id": 226, "rank": 7.35235, "firstReward": 190, "repeatReward": 85, "layoutSeed": 18362, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 27, "pressure": 1.456 }, { "title": "The Smell of Bread", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 5, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Defend the approach to the bakery", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The field bakery has just lit its ovens. The enemy reaches the road before the fresh bread has cooled. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the approach to the bakery.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “The Smell of Bread.”", "letter": "“The Smell of Bread.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 20, "id": 227, "rank": 7.38488, "firstReward": 191, "repeatReward": 85, "legacyId": 34, "layoutSeed": 34, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 28, "pressure": 1.458 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-029", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 11, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-029. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-029.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-029. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 22, "id": 228, "rank": 7.41742, "firstReward": 199, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 18436, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 29, "pressure": 1.46 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-030", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-030. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-030.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-030. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 22, "id": 229, "rank": 7.44995, "firstReward": 199, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 18473, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 30, "pressure": 1.462 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-031", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-031. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-031.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-031. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 19, "id": 230, "rank": 7.48248, "firstReward": 187, "repeatReward": 84, "layoutSeed": 18510, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 31, "pressure": 1.464 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-032", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-032. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-032.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-032. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 19, "id": 231, "rank": 7.51502, "firstReward": 187, "repeatReward": 84, "layoutSeed": 18547, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 32, "pressure": 1.466 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-033", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-033. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-033.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-033. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 21, "id": 232, "rank": 7.54755, "firstReward": 196, "repeatReward": 88, "layoutSeed": 18584, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 33, "pressure": 1.468 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-034", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "mud", "map": 1, "weather": "rain", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-034. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-034.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-034. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 21, "id": 233, "rank": 7.58008, "firstReward": 196, "repeatReward": 88, "layoutSeed": 18621, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 34, "pressure": 1.47 }, { "title": "The Distant Bell", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 8, "weather": "rain", "trait": "elite", "base": "Cover the withdrawal along the country lane", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "A bell in a ruined tower has become a landmark for the convoy. Sokolov makes his stand at its foot. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Cover the withdrawal along the country lane.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The Distant Bell.”", "letter": "“The Distant Bell.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 18, "id": 234, "rank": 7.61261, "firstReward": 184, "repeatReward": 82, "legacyId": 35, "layoutSeed": 35, "original": true, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 35, "pressure": 1.472 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-036", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 21, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-036. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-036.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-036. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 18, "id": 235, "rank": 7.64515, "firstReward": 184, "repeatReward": 82, "layoutSeed": 18695, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 36, "pressure": 1.474 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-037", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 7, "weather": "rain", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-037. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-037.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-037. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 20, "id": 236, "rank": 7.67768, "firstReward": 192, "repeatReward": 86, "layoutSeed": 18732, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 37, "pressure": 1.476 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-038", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 17, "weather": "rain", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-038. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-038.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-038. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 20, "id": 237, "rank": 7.71021, "firstReward": 192, "repeatReward": 86, "layoutSeed": 18769, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 38, "pressure": 1.478 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-039", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 3, "weather": "rain", "trait": "mud", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-039. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-039.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-039. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 22, "id": 238, "rank": 7.74274, "firstReward": 201, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 18806, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 39, "pressure": 1.48 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-040", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 13, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-040. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-040.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-040. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 22, "id": 239, "rank": 7.77528, "firstReward": 201, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 18843, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 1, "orderInChapter": 40, "pressure": 1.482 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-041", "place": "Mozhaisk Sector", "date": "October 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "forest", "map": 22, "weather": "rain", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-041. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-041.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-041. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 19, "id": 240, "rank": 7.80781, "firstReward": 189, "repeatReward": 85, "layoutSeed": 18880, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 41, "pressure": 1.484 }, { "title": "The Last Level Crossing", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Railway Crossing", "quote": "“Snow hid the road, but not the tank tracks.”", "story": "The first snow settles on unfrozen ground. Repair trains pass through the crossing toward the rear. Enemy armoured carriers attempt a rapid breakthrough. Belov shifts the guns beside a long stretch of road where they can keep firing.", "objective": "Stop the armoured column at the crossing.", "tip": "This mission has more armoured transports. Give anti-tank guns clear stretches of road to fire along.", "outro": "The damaged train leaves in the snowfall. Nina writes: “Communications intact. Crossing clear.”", "letter": "Today I received my first letter from home. I read it as if reading longer could shorten the wait for spring.", "waves": 20, "id": 241, "rank": 7.84034, "firstReward": 193, "repeatReward": 87, "legacyId": 36, "layoutSeed": 36, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 42, "pressure": 1.486 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-043", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-043. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-043.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-043. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 22, "id": 242, "rank": 7.87287, "firstReward": 201, "repeatReward": 91, "layoutSeed": 18954, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 43, "pressure": 1.488 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-044", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-044. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-044.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-044. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 22, "id": 243, "rank": 7.90541, "firstReward": 201, "repeatReward": 91, "layoutSeed": 18991, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 44, "pressure": 1.49 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-045", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-045. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-045.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-045. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 19, "id": 244, "rank": 7.93794, "firstReward": 190, "repeatReward": 85, "layoutSeed": 19028, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 45, "pressure": 1.492 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-046", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-046. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-046.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-046. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 19, "id": 245, "rank": 7.97047, "firstReward": 190, "repeatReward": 85, "layoutSeed": 19065, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 46, "pressure": 1.494 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-047", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 10, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-047. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-047.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-047. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 21, "id": 246, "rank": 8.003, "firstReward": 198, "repeatReward": 89, "layoutSeed": 19102, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 47, "pressure": 1.496 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-048", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-048. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-048.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-048. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 21, "id": 247, "rank": 8.03554, "firstReward": 198, "repeatReward": 89, "layoutSeed": 19139, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 48, "pressure": 1.498 }, { "title": "The Trackwalker's Lantern", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the trackwalker's post", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "The trackwalker returns from a distant post with a diagram of the damage. His lantern becomes a signal for the entire company. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the trackwalker's post.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “The Trackwalker's Lantern — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“The Trackwalker's Lantern.” Belov says a road remembers everyone who repaired it. I hope it remembers those we helped escape along it, too.", "waves": 23, "id": 248, "rank": 8.06807, "firstReward": 206, "repeatReward": 93, "legacyId": 37, "layoutSeed": 37, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 49, "pressure": 1.5 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-050", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 16, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-050. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-050.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-050. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 23, "id": 249, "rank": 8.1006, "firstReward": 206, "repeatReward": 93, "layoutSeed": 19213, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 50, "pressure": 1.502 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-051", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-051. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-051.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-051. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 20, "id": 250, "rank": 8.13313, "firstReward": 195, "repeatReward": 87, "layoutSeed": 19250, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 51, "pressure": 1.504 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-052", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-052. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-052.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-052. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 20, "id": 251, "rank": 8.16567, "firstReward": 195, "repeatReward": 88, "layoutSeed": 19287, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 52, "pressure": 1.506 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-053", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-053. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-053.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-053. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 22, "id": 252, "rank": 8.1982, "firstReward": 203, "repeatReward": 92, "layoutSeed": 19324, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 53, "pressure": 1.508 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-054", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-054. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-054.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-054. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 19, "id": 253, "rank": 8.23073, "firstReward": 191, "repeatReward": 86, "layoutSeed": 19361, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 54, "pressure": 1.51 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-055", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-055. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-055.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-055. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 19, "id": 254, "rank": 8.26326, "firstReward": 191, "repeatReward": 86, "layoutSeed": 19398, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 55, "pressure": 1.512 }, { "title": "Coal for the Locomotive", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Cover the delivery of fuel", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "A train reaches the station with no fuel left. Belov organises a coal detail at the ruined depot. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Cover the delivery of fuel.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “Coal for the Locomotive” on their route map.", "letter": "“Coal for the Locomotive.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 21, "id": 255, "rank": 8.2958, "firstReward": 199, "repeatReward": 90, "legacyId": 38, "layoutSeed": 38, "original": true, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 56, "pressure": 1.514 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-057", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-057. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-057.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-057. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 21, "id": 256, "rank": 8.32833, "firstReward": 200, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 19472, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 57, "pressure": 1.516 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-058", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-058. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-058.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-058. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 23, "id": 257, "rank": 8.36086, "firstReward": 208, "repeatReward": 94, "layoutSeed": 19509, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 58, "pressure": 1.518 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-059", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-059. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-059.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-059. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 23, "id": 258, "rank": 8.39339, "firstReward": 208, "repeatReward": 94, "layoutSeed": 19546, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 59, "pressure": 1.52 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-060", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-060. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-060.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-060. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 20, "id": 259, "rank": 8.42593, "firstReward": 196, "repeatReward": 88, "layoutSeed": 19583, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 2, "orderInChapter": 60, "pressure": 1.522 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-061", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-061. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-061.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-061. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 20, "id": 260, "rank": 8.45846, "firstReward": 196, "repeatReward": 88, "layoutSeed": 19620, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 61, "pressure": 1.524 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-062", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-062. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-062.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-062. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 22, "id": 261, "rank": 8.49099, "firstReward": 205, "repeatReward": 92, "layoutSeed": 19657, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 62, "pressure": 1.526 }, { "title": "Sorting the Mail", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Hold the station throat", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "The train waits for permission to continue. Nina uses the halt to sort the saved letters by field address. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Hold the station throat.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “Sorting the Mail” to the company's story.", "letter": "“Sorting the Mail.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 22, "id": 262, "rank": 8.52352, "firstReward": 205, "repeatReward": 93, "legacyId": 39, "layoutSeed": 39, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 63, "pressure": 1.528 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-064", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-064. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-064.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-064. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 19, "id": 263, "rank": 8.55606, "firstReward": 193, "repeatReward": 87, "layoutSeed": 19731, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 64, "pressure": 1.53 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-065", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-065. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-065.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-065. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 19, "id": 264, "rank": 8.58859, "firstReward": 193, "repeatReward": 87, "layoutSeed": 19768, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 65, "pressure": 1.532 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-066", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-066. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-066.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-066. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 21, "id": 265, "rank": 8.62112, "firstReward": 201, "repeatReward": 91, "layoutSeed": 19805, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 66, "pressure": 1.535 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-067", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-067. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-067.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-067. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 21, "id": 266, "rank": 8.65365, "firstReward": 201, "repeatReward": 91, "layoutSeed": 19842, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 67, "pressure": 1.537 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-068", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-068. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-068.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-068. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 267, "rank": 8.68619, "firstReward": 214, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 19879, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 68, "pressure": 1.539 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-069", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-069. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-069.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-069. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 24, "id": 268, "rank": 8.71872, "firstReward": 214, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 19916, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 69, "pressure": 1.541 }, { "title": "Eight Working Wheels", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Protect the repair shelter", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Mechanics assemble two working vehicles from several damaged ones. The enemy is approaching their repair shelter. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Protect the repair shelter.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “Eight Working Wheels.”", "letter": "“Eight Working Wheels.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 21, "id": 269, "rank": 8.75125, "firstReward": 202, "repeatReward": 91, "legacyId": 40, "layoutSeed": 40, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 70, "pressure": 1.543 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-071", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-071. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-071.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-071. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 21, "id": 270, "rank": 8.78378, "firstReward": 202, "repeatReward": 91, "layoutSeed": 19990, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 71, "pressure": 1.545 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-072", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-072. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-072.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-072. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 23, "id": 271, "rank": 8.81632, "firstReward": 210, "repeatReward": 95, "layoutSeed": 20027, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 72, "pressure": 1.547 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-073", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-073. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-073.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-073. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 23, "id": 272, "rank": 8.84885, "firstReward": 210, "repeatReward": 95, "layoutSeed": 20064, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 73, "pressure": 1.549 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-074", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 17, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-074. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-074.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-074. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 20, "id": 273, "rank": 8.88138, "firstReward": 199, "repeatReward": 89, "layoutSeed": 20101, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 74, "pressure": 1.551 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-075", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-075. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-075.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-075. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 20, "id": 274, "rank": 8.91391, "firstReward": 199, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 20138, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 75, "pressure": 1.553 }, { "title": "The White Marker", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Defend the approaches to the crossing", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A tall marker is raised beside the crossing at night. It must guide those who have not yet found friendly lines. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the crossing.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “The White Marker.”", "letter": "“The White Marker.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 22, "id": 275, "rank": 8.94645, "firstReward": 207, "repeatReward": 94, "legacyId": 41, "layoutSeed": 41, "original": true, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 76, "pressure": 1.555 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-077", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-077. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-077.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-077. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 22, "id": 276, "rank": 8.97898, "firstReward": 207, "repeatReward": 94, "layoutSeed": 20212, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 77, "pressure": 1.557 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-078", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-078. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-078.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-078. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 24, "id": 277, "rank": 9.01151, "firstReward": 215, "repeatReward": 98, "layoutSeed": 20249, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 78, "pressure": 1.559 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-079", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-079. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-079.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-079. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 24, "id": 278, "rank": 9.04404, "firstReward": 215, "repeatReward": 98, "layoutSeed": 20286, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 79, "pressure": 1.561 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-080", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-080. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-080.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-080. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 21, "id": 279, "rank": 9.07658, "firstReward": 204, "repeatReward": 92, "layoutSeed": 20323, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 3, "orderInChapter": 80, "pressure": 1.563 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-081", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-081. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-081.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-081. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 21, "id": 280, "rank": 9.10911, "firstReward": 204, "repeatReward": 92, "layoutSeed": 20360, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 81, "pressure": 1.565 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-082", "place": "Volokolamsk Sector", "date": "November 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-082. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-082.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-082. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 23, "id": 281, "rank": 9.14164, "firstReward": 212, "repeatReward": 96, "layoutSeed": 20397, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 82, "pressure": 1.567 }, { "title": "A December Night", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Communications Node", "quote": "“Tomorrow, the road will lead us forward for the first time.”", "story": "The company holds a communications hub before a new movement of the front. Cable reels freeze in the wind, and Nina warms the connectors beside a portable stove. Every message matters in the long night. Enemy attacks along the road threaten to silence the station.", "objective": "Keep the communications hub operating until the guard changes.", "tip": "Frost slows enemies by 8%. Upgrades increase both damage and range.", "outro": "New orders arrive at dawn. Sokolov erases the retreat arrow and holds his pencil over the empty space for a long time.", "letter": "Mother, today we did not retreat. I will write it again: today we did not retreat.", "waves": 23, "id": 282, "rank": 9.17417, "firstReward": 212, "repeatReward": 96, "legacyId": 42, "layoutSeed": 42, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 83, "pressure": 1.569 }, { "title": "Mill Road · B-084", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 20, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Mill Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Drivers are changing a roadside wheel with their lamps covered. Sokolov assigns firing sectors while Belov checks the crew shelters. Sector B-084. Sector orders: Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "objective": "Protect the delivery of flour and provisions.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Mill Road · B-084.", "letter": "Mill Road · B-084. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 20, "id": 283, "rank": 9.20671, "firstReward": 200, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 20471, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 84, "pressure": 1.571 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-085", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 6, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-085. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-085.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-085. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 20, "id": 284, "rank": 9.23924, "firstReward": 200, "repeatReward": 90, "layoutSeed": 20508, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 85, "pressure": 1.573 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-086", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 16, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-086. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-086.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-086. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 22, "id": 285, "rank": 9.27177, "firstReward": 209, "repeatReward": 95, "layoutSeed": 20545, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 86, "pressure": 1.575 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-087", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The sentry hears engines beyond the trees. There is no time left to move the cargo. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-087. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-087.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-087. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 22, "id": 286, "rank": 9.3043, "firstReward": 209, "repeatReward": 95, "layoutSeed": 20582, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 87, "pressure": 1.577 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-088", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-088. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-088.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-088. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 24, "id": 287, "rank": 9.33684, "firstReward": 217, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 20619, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 88, "pressure": 1.579 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-089", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A neighbouring company asks for the passage to be held a little longer. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-089. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-089.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-089. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 24, "id": 288, "rank": 9.36937, "firstReward": 217, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 20656, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 89, "pressure": 1.581 }, { "title": "Tea from a Mess Tin", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Hold the winter line", "quote": "“A long road is fine, as long as it leads home.”", "story": "The first hot tea in a day reaches the positions. Belov shares it among the crews while Nina listens to anxious radio traffic. Retreat now would leave people without cover. The company accepts battle on the chosen ground.", "objective": "Hold the winter line.", "tip": "Machine guns and mortars hold dense groups. Place them around a long bend.", "outro": "The line holds. The log reads: “Tea from a Mess Tin — task complete.” Nina puts the journal safely beside the mailbag.", "letter": "“Tea from a Mess Tin.” We gained one more quiet minute. I used it to finish these lines to you.", "waves": 21, "id": 289, "rank": 9.4019, "firstReward": 205, "repeatReward": 93, "legacyId": 43, "layoutSeed": 43, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 90, "pressure": 1.583 }, { "title": "Field Kitchen · B-091", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 18, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Field Kitchen", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Nina marks the safe bends on her map and transmits a short order. Sector B-091. Sector orders: Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "objective": "Keep the route to the field kitchen open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Field Kitchen · B-091.", "letter": "Field Kitchen · B-091. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 23, "id": 290, "rank": 9.43443, "firstReward": 214, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 20730, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 91, "pressure": 1.585 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-092", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-092. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-092.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-092. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 23, "id": 291, "rank": 9.46697, "firstReward": 214, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 20767, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 92, "pressure": 1.587 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-093", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The reserve route is blocked. All traffic must pass through this line. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-093. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-093.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-093. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 21, "id": 292, "rank": 9.4995, "firstReward": 206, "repeatReward": 93, "layoutSeed": 20804, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 93, "pressure": 1.589 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-094", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 12, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-094. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-094.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-094. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 21, "id": 293, "rank": 9.53203, "firstReward": 206, "repeatReward": 93, "layoutSeed": 20841, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 94, "pressure": 1.591 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-095", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 22, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-095. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-095.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-095. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 23, "id": 294, "rank": 9.56456, "firstReward": 214, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 20878, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 95, "pressure": 1.593 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-096", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. Scouts have spotted movement on a nearby track: the detour is no longer safe. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-096. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-096.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-096. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 23, "id": 295, "rank": 9.5971, "firstReward": 214, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 20915, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 96, "pressure": 1.595 }, { "title": "The Frozen Breech", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Defend the sector while the guns are serviced", "quote": "“Not every precious cargo belongs on an inventory.”", "story": "Frost is jamming the weapons. Sokolov rotates crews through brief inspections so the road never loses its covering fire. The next signal is due soon. The road must be held with the forces already present.", "objective": "Defend the sector while the guns are serviced.", "tip": "Starting supplies are higher than usual. Cover several sectors before upgrading positions.", "outro": "The crews withdraw only after the all-clear. Belov marks “The Frozen Breech” on their route map.", "letter": "“The Frozen Breech.” Fewer addresses in the notebook remain unread. One day I will close it and write a letter without rushing.", "waves": 25, "id": 296, "rank": 9.62963, "firstReward": 223, "repeatReward": 102, "legacyId": 44, "layoutSeed": 44, "original": true, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 97, "pressure": 1.597 }, { "title": "Courier Route · B-098", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 4, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Courier Route", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Belov places spare crates beside the guns and reminds the crews not to fire too early. Sector B-098. Sector orders: Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "objective": "Keep the route open for couriers and field mail.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Courier Route · B-098.", "letter": "Courier Route · B-098. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 25, "id": 297, "rank": 9.66216, "firstReward": 223, "repeatReward": 102, "layoutSeed": 20989, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 98, "pressure": 1.599 }, { "title": "Water Pump · B-099", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 14, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Water Pump", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The leading vehicle has broken down, leaving the convoy stretched around a bend. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-099. Sector orders: Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "objective": "Let the water trucks finish loading at the pump.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Water Pump · B-099.", "letter": "Water Pump · B-099. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 22, "id": 298, "rank": 9.69469, "firstReward": 211, "repeatReward": 96, "layoutSeed": 21026, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 99, "pressure": 1.601 }, { "title": "Repair Yard · B-100", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 0, "weather": "snow", "trait": "armor", "base": "Repair Yard", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-100. Sector orders: Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "objective": "Defend the repair yard until the last vehicle departs.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Repair Yard · B-100.", "letter": "Repair Yard · B-100. Today we guarded not a point on a map, but someone’s chance to get home.", "waves": 22, "id": 299, "rank": 9.72723, "firstReward": 211, "repeatReward": 96, "layoutSeed": 21063, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 4, "orderInChapter": 100, "pressure": 1.603 }, { "title": "Field Crossroads · B-101", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Field Crossroads", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-101. Sector orders: Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "objective": "Prevent a breakthrough to the field crossroads.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Field Crossroads · B-101.", "letter": "Field Crossroads · B-101. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 24, "id": 300, "rank": 9.75976, "firstReward": 219, "repeatReward": 100, "layoutSeed": 21100, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 101, "pressure": 1.605 }, { "title": "Wire through the Woods · B-102", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 21, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Wire through the Woods", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The wire is cut. Until communications return, the crews must follow signal flags. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-102. Sector orders: Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "objective": "Cover the laying of a new telephone line.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Wire through the Woods · B-102.", "letter": "Wire through the Woods · B-102. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 24, "id": 301, "rank": 9.79229, "firstReward": 219, "repeatReward": 100, "layoutSeed": 21137, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 102, "pressure": 1.607 }, { "title": "Sapper Patrol · B-103", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "frostwood", "map": 7, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Sapper Patrol", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-103. Sector orders: Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "objective": "Hold the road while sappers check the next section.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The signallers report that the route is working again. Sapper Patrol · B-103.", "letter": "Sapper Patrol · B-103. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 21, "id": 302, "rank": 9.82482, "firstReward": 208, "repeatReward": 94, "layoutSeed": 21174, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 103, "pressure": 1.609 }, { "title": "The Signaller's Sledge", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 2, "weather": "snow", "trait": "elite", "base": "Cover the signallers' approach", "quote": "“We do not hold for a mark on a map.”", "story": "Cable and batteries arrive on a homemade sledge. The signallers still have to cross an exposed lane to reach the radio post. Behind the line, people need quiet and time to work. Ahead lies a road that cannot be left open.", "objective": "Cover the signallers' approach.", "tip": "Trucks are tougher than infantry. Rifle squads and anti-tank guns help stop transport.", "outro": "Sokolov receives confirmation: the people and cargo are safe. Nina adds “The Signaller's Sledge” to the company's story.", "letter": "“The Signaller's Sledge.” I will remember not the battle's noise, but the headlights of the vehicle that made it past our line.", "waves": 21, "id": 303, "rank": 9.85736, "firstReward": 208, "repeatReward": 94, "legacyId": 45, "layoutSeed": 45, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 104, "pressure": 1.611 }, { "title": "Assembly Point · B-105", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 3, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Assembly Point", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The night patrol has brought a sketch of a new enemy approach. Sokolov reserves supplies for repairs and checks the last bend. Sector B-105. Sector orders: Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "objective": "Keep the route from the assembly point to the rear open.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Assembly Point · B-105.", "letter": "Assembly Point · B-105. Belov says a good position begins with looking after the next crew.", "waves": 23, "id": 304, "rank": 9.88989, "firstReward": 216, "repeatReward": 98, "layoutSeed": 21248, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 105, "pressure": 1.613 }, { "title": "Observation Post · B-106", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 13, "weather": "snow", "trait": "frost", "base": "Observation Post", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-106. Sector orders: Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "objective": "Defend the approaches to the observation post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Observation Post · B-106.", "letter": "Observation Post · B-106. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 23, "id": 305, "rank": 9.92242, "firstReward": 216, "repeatReward": 98, "layoutSeed": 21285, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 106, "pressure": 1.615 }, { "title": "Spare Parts Truck · B-107", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 23, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Spare Parts Truck", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-107. Sector orders: Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "objective": "Cover the truck carrying spare parts.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Spare Parts Truck · B-107.", "letter": "Spare Parts Truck · B-107. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 25, "id": 306, "rank": 9.95495, "firstReward": 224, "repeatReward": 102, "layoutSeed": 21322, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 107, "pressure": 1.617 }, { "title": "Rations Depot · B-108", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Rations Depot", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A group of wounded is moving to the rear; they cannot be hurried. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-108. Sector orders: Hold the road to the rations depot.", "objective": "Hold the road to the rations depot.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Sappers remove the barriers to let friendly vehicles through. Rations Depot · B-108.", "letter": "Rations Depot · B-108. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 25, "id": 307, "rank": 9.98749, "firstReward": 224, "repeatReward": 102, "layoutSeed": 21359, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 108, "pressure": 1.619 }, { "title": "Bridge Approach · B-109", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Bridge Approach", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-109. Sector orders: Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "objective": "Protect the bridge approach against a counterattack.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Bridge Approach · B-109.", "letter": "Bridge Approach · B-109. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 22, "id": 308, "rank": 10.02002, "firstReward": 213, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 21396, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 109, "pressure": 1.621 }, { "title": "Roadside Shelter · B-110", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Roadside Shelter", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. A small bridge has sagged under the load. Belov leaves a repair team beside it. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-110. Sector orders: Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "objective": "Cover the temporary roadside shelter.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Roadside Shelter · B-110.", "letter": "Roadside Shelter · B-110. Nina counted the letters again. Not one was left on the road.", "waves": 22, "id": 309, "rank": 10.05255, "firstReward": 213, "repeatReward": 97, "layoutSeed": 21433, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 110, "pressure": 1.623 }, { "title": "A Lamp over the Map", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scouts", "base": "Hold the road to headquarters", "quote": "“Someone is waiting for our help beyond every bend.”", "story": "A small lamp glows inside the dugout. The map once again shows neighbouring units that need help. The company fortifies the roadside. Every minute gained brings the task closer to completion.", "objective": "Hold the road to headquarters.", "tip": "Overlapping fields of fire matter on this road. Leave room for engineers near the busiest bend.", "outro": "The last vehicle rounds the bend. On the back of the map, Belov writes the name of this day: “A Lamp over the Map.”", "letter": "“A Lamp over the Map.” Today we guarded someone else's hope again. Perhaps these small acts are what make a road home.", "waves": 24, "id": 310, "rank": 10.08509, "firstReward": 221, "repeatReward": 101, "legacyId": 46, "layoutSeed": 46, "original": true, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 111, "pressure": 1.625 }, { "title": "Supply Relay · B-112", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 1, "weather": "snow", "trait": "fog", "base": "Supply Relay", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. Nina puts the letters in a waterproof cover: today they need a safe road again. Sector B-112. Sector orders: Defend the intermediate supply base.", "objective": "Defend the intermediate supply base.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The last truck sounds its horn beyond the bend. Supply Relay · B-112.", "letter": "Supply Relay · B-112. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 24, "id": 311, "rank": 10.11762, "firstReward": 221, "repeatReward": 101, "layoutSeed": 21507, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 112, "pressure": 1.627 }, { "title": "Clearing the Road · B-113", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 11, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Clearing the Road", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-113. Sector orders: Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "objective": "Buy time to clear the roadblock.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Clearing the Road · B-113.", "letter": "Clearing the Road · B-113. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 21, "id": 312, "rank": 10.15015, "firstReward": 209, "repeatReward": 95, "layoutSeed": 21544, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 113, "pressure": 1.629 }, { "title": "Radio Silence · B-114", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 9, "weather": "snow", "trait": "scarcity", "base": "Radio Silence", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. This bend is marked incorrectly on the map. Scouts check the route just before the battle. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-114. Sector orders: Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "objective": "Cover the signal crews while they restore the radio post.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Radio Silence · B-114.", "letter": "Radio Silence · B-114. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 21, "id": 313, "rank": 10.18268, "firstReward": 209, "repeatReward": 95, "layoutSeed": 21581, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 114, "pressure": 1.631 }, { "title": "Hospital Bend · B-115", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 19, "weather": "snow", "trait": "bridgehead", "base": "Hospital Bend", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-115. Sector orders: Hold the road for the ambulances.", "objective": "Hold the road for the ambulances.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Hospital Bend · B-115.", "letter": "Hospital Bend · B-115. Weariness comes after battle. While the convoy moves behind us, we hardly notice it.", "waves": 23, "id": 314, "rank": 10.21522, "firstReward": 218, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 21618, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 115, "pressure": 1.633 }, { "title": "Roadside Crates · B-116", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 5, "weather": "snow", "trait": "none", "base": "Roadside Crates", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-116. Sector orders: Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "objective": "Protect ammunition unloading beside the track.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. Another defended road is recorded in the company journal. Roadside Crates · B-116.", "letter": "Roadside Crates · B-116. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 23, "id": 315, "rank": 10.24775, "firstReward": 218, "repeatReward": 99, "layoutSeed": 21655, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 116, "pressure": 1.635 }, { "title": "Timber Convoy · B-117", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "village", "map": 15, "weather": "snow", "trait": "convoy", "base": "Timber Convoy", "quote": "", "story": "The crews now work together. Every new position must give the neighbouring unit a chance to dig in. The last truck has not arrived, so it is too early to leave the position. The crews take their familiar positions. Each knows which part of the road to cover. Sector B-117. Sector orders: Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "objective": "Escort building supplies through a dangerous bend.", "tip": "Combine area fire with anti-tank guns. Repair damaged positions between waves; paid support is not required.", "outro": "The line holds. The convoy passes the sector without stopping. Timber Convoy · B-117.", "letter": "Timber Convoy · B-117. We are learning to save not only supplies, but each other’s time.", "waves": 25, "id": 316, "rank": 10.28028, "firstReward": 226, "repeatReward": 103, "layoutSeed": 21692, "original": false, "legacyId": null, "sector": 5, "orderInChapter": 117, "pressure": 1.637 }, { "title": "Snow on the Envelopes", "place": "Moscow Region", "date": "December 1941", "chapter": 1, "theme": "snow", "map": 8, "weather": "snow", "trait": "supplies", "base": "Protect the field mail handover point", "quote": "“A good position saves more shells than a full crate.”", "story": "Nina dries letters over a cup of hot water. One envelope still bears the outline of a child's hand. Sokolov chooses positions, Nina establishes communications, and Belov shares ammunition among the crews.", "objective": "Protect the field mail handover point.", "tip": "Do not spend all your supplies at once. Balance upgrades with new positions farther down the road.", "outro": "The road belongs to the column again. Nina checks the letters; Sokolov thanks the crews who held “Snow on the Envelopes.”", "letter": "“Snow on the Envelopes.” Belov says a road remembers every